- Interpolate only via the four printed columns (70 / 85 / 100 / 120). Use `interpolate` / `pointAt` — do not fit a new curve.
- Fixed in every column for an option: admin, Rx reprice, stop-loss premium, aggregate premium, laser. Claims and dividend/true-up move.
